{"code":"uk-UA","name":"Ukrainian","native":"Українська","badge":"УК","tts":"uk-UA","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Я не розумію.","say":"ya ne ro-zoo-MEE-yu","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Я не знаю.","say":"ya ne ZNA-yu","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Хвилинку, будь ласка.","say":"khvy-LYN-koo, bood LAS-ka","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Повторіть, будь ласка.","say":"pov-to-REET, bood LAS-ka","en":"Please say that again.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Повільніше, будь ласка.","say":"po-veel-NEE-she, bood LAS-ka","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Як сказати «…» українською?","say":"yak ska-ZA-ty … oo-kra-YEEN-sko-yu","en":"How do you say “…” in Ukrainian?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Звичайно.","say":"zvy-CHAI-no","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Точно.","say":"TOCH-no","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Думаю, що так.","say":"DOO-ma-yu, shcho tak","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Справді?","say":"SPRAV-dee","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Без проблем.","say":"bez pro-BLEM","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Чудово!","say":"choo-DO-vo","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Де {x}?","say":"de {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Я хочу {x:acc}.","say":"ya kho-CHOO {x:acc}","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"У вас є {x}?","say":"oo vas YE {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, будь ласка.","say":"{x:acc}, bood LAS-ka","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Мені треба {x}.","say":"me-NEE TRE-ba {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Можна {x}?","say":"MOZH-na {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Я перевірю.","say":"ya pe-re-VEE-ryu","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"У мене зустріч.","say":"oo ME-ne ZOOS-treech","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Це гостре?","say":"tse HOS-tre","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Без цибулі, будь ласка.","say":"bez tsy-BOO-lee, bood LAS-ka","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Що ви порадите?","say":"shcho vy po-RA-dy-te","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Я не їм м’яса.","say":"ya ne yeem MYA-sa","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Скільки коштує?","say":"SKEEL-ky KOSH-too-ye","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Я просто дивлюся.","say":"ya PROS-to dyv-LYU-sya","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Я візьму це.","say":"ya veez-MOO tse","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Можна карткою?","say":"MOZH-na KART-ko-yu","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Це далеко?","say":"tse da-le-KO","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"До аеропорту, будь ласка.","say":"do a-e-ro-POR-too, bood LAS-ka","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"ліворуч · праворуч · прямо","say":"lee-VO-rooch · pra-VO-rooch · PRYA-mo","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Допоможіть!","say":"do-po-mo-ZHEET","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Немає туалетного паперу.","say":"ne-MA-ye too-a-LET-no-ho pa-PE-roo","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Мені погано.","say":"me-NEE po-HA-no","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Викличте швидку, будь ласка.","say":"VY-klych-te shvyd-KOO, bood LAS-ka","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Приємно познайомитися.","say":"pry-YEM-no poz-na-YO-my-ty-sya","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Звідки ви?","say":"ZVEED-ky vy","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Ким ви працюєте?","say":"kym vy pra-TSYU-ye-te","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Дуже смачно!","say":"DOO-zhe SMACH-no","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Привіт.","say":"pry-VEET","en":"Hi.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Доброго ранку.","say":"DOB-ro-ho RAN-koo","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Як справи?","say":"yak SPRA-vy","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Так. · Ні.","say":"tak · nee","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Будь ласка.","say":"bood LAS-ka","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Дякую.","say":"DYA-koo-yu","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Вибачте.","say":"VY-bach-te","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"До побачення.","say":"do po-BA-chen-nya","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"один · два · три","say":"o-DYN · dva · try","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"чотири · п’ять · шість","say":"cho-TY-ry · pyat · sheest","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"сім · вісім · дев’ять","say":"seem · VEE-seem · DE-vyat","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"десять · двадцять · сто","say":"DE-syat · DVAD-tsyat · sto","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Яблуко червоне.","say":"YAB-loo-ko cher-VO-ne","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” and no “a / the”"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Я їм яблуко.","say":"ya yeem YAB-loo-ko","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"endings, not word order, show who does what"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Я з’їв яблуко.","say":"ya zyeev YAB-loo-ko","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past ends in -в (a woman says з’їла)"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Я хочу з’їсти яблуко.","say":"ya kho-CHOO ZYEES-ty YAB-loo-ko","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Ти їси яблука?","say":"ty yee-SY YAB-loo-ka","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"same words; the voice rises (or start with Чи)"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"туалет","say":"too-a-LET","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"аптека","say":"ap-TE-ka","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"лікарня","say":"lee-KAR-nya","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"вокзал","say":"vok-ZAL","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"аеропорт","say":"a-e-ro-PORT","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"готель","say":"ho-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"вода","say":"vo-DA","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink","acc":"воду","accSay":"VO-doo"},{"id":"coffee","t":"кава","say":"KA-va","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink","acc":"каву","accSay":"KA-voo"},{"id":"bill","t":"рахунок","say":"ra-KHOO-nok","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"меню","say":"me-NYU","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"пиво","say":"PY-vo","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"це","say":"tse","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"пакет","say":"pa-KET","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"зустріч","say":"ZOOS-treech","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"файл","say":"fail","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"екран","say":"e-KRAN","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"повідомлення","say":"po-vee-DOM-len-nya","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"завтра","say":"ZAV-tra","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"йти","say":"yty","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"увійти","say":"oo-veey-TY","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"заплатити","say":"za-pla-TY-ty","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Алергія · будь ласка, прочитайте","ask":"Чи є щось із цього в цій страві?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Дуже дякую!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"У мене сильна алергія на арахіс. Мені не можна арахіс і арахісову олію.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"У мене сильна алергія на морепродукти (креветки, краби, молюски).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Мені не можна глютен (пшениця, ячмінь, жито).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Я не їм м’яса, курки та риби.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Я не їм свинини.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"ТУАЛЕТ","en":"Restroom"},{"t":"Ч · Ж","en":"Ч = men (чоловіки), Ж = women (жінки)","warn":true},{"t":"ВИХІД · ВХІД","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ВІД СЕБЕ · ДО СЕБЕ","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"ЗАПАСНИЙ ВИХІД","en":"Emergency exit"}]}